{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太華山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即毛淡棉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "總觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀法身佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀報身佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀應身佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂得人和則天時地利均歸時之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太虛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陶冶公"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳耕石"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃懺華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陶冶公"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太虛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二王謂船山、湘綺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福善句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立春前夕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國元年，曾約王文典陪先\n生赴杭未果，今聞先生新遊西子湖來也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻冷眼靜觀時局起興也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "風喻列強，池喻中國，柳喻軍閥，言軍閥受列強利用以亂中國也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "波喻政局，水喻國家，萍喻人民，言政局搖動，國家人民不安也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紅燈夕陽喻赤軍列強之盛，不久當如黃葉之紛紛落於空庭也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由此觀之，世界不久當由亂而趨於治，故詩人相喻於心陶然自得也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋菊喻孫傳芳，雞冠喻蔣中正，昔孫蔣猶爭強於贛也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻赤化雖烈，但勢難久持。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻張作霖旁觀，如怪石之玲瓏精巧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻人民希望和平幸福，似魚嚼影也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻外人因中國之亂，而聲言欲共管或瓜分也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻時局變化多端，總云不能盡也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言時政美惡靡常，惟詩人超然物外，可自樂其樂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言詩人之溫柔敦\n\n厚，當以宗教安慰民情也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言當如張南通興實業以舒民生，老而益壯也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言民生已舒，當興教育，但須志聖賢不尚功利。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言人生有不朽之價值，不與草木同腐。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言識得人生真相，則由世間而超出世間矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故釋迦大悲維摩示病，皆詩人之存心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚴正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寬和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甬江重別白慧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋感"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中秋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "焦山春望"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "海樓春晚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喜湛菴重訪普陀疊在京口見懷韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喜憨杜多出關見過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與湛菴亦幻同作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甬江塔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪竇山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "資聖寺"}
